anet this is interesting  since early on in the movie we hear this  never one drop of rain on arrakis paul  has made it rain and the ending credits  show ocean waves in the background you  may also have noticed paul's blue eyes  much like those of the fremen these are  called eyes of a bad and are  characteristic of those exposed to high  amounts of spice now you might ask  yourself where does this leave paul and  lee freeman well that i'm going to save  for another video since those events are  depicted in subsequent novels in the  days ahead i hope to cover the 2020  version as well as the 2000 and 2003  mini series based on the other novels  children of dune so make sure to  subscribe with notifications on for that  thanks for watching everyone be sure to  like the video and leave a comment with  your dune thoughts and for more bad  takes you can always find me on twitter  and instagram at pink story yt until  next time remember daddy loves you very  much

